  "content": "<h1>使舊版本（低於1.8.57）的「<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slashblade-resharped\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SlashBlade: Resharped</a>」與<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/accelerated-rendering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">加速渲染</a>相容。&nbsp;</h1><p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>您仍可在此版本以上添加此模組，但功能將無法運作 :P</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>若有任何想法或錯誤，請：</strong></span><br><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Arcomit/AcceleratedBlade/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">Issues · Arcomit/AcceleratedBlade</a></strong></span><br><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>或</strong></span><br><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Arcomit/AcceleratedBlade/pulls\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pull requests · Arcomit/AcceleratedBlade</a></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>Github：</strong></span><br><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Arcomit/AcceleratedBlade\" rel=\"nofollow\">Arcomit/AcceleratedBlade: 讓全版本重鋒相容加速渲染</a></span></strong><br><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>授權協議：</strong></span><br><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Arcomit/AcceleratedBlade/blob/master/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">LGPL-2.1 license</a></span></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>————————————————————————————————————</strong></span></p><h5><br>讓舊版本（低於1.8.57）重鋒相容加速渲染。</h5><h5><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">高於這個版本您仍然可以添加此模組，但功能並不會生效:P</span></h5><p>&nbsp;</p><h5><strong>有想法或錯誤，請：</strong><br><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/Arcomit/AcceleratedBlade/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">Issues · Arcomit/AcceleratedBlade</a></strong></span><br><strong>或</strong><br><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><a style=